Q: How to access the row data from CodeIgniter&#39;s query result object A: <p>It seems you are not running the query. You just framed it.</p>

<pre><code>public function get_my_band($artist_ref) {

    $this-&gt;db-&gt;select('*');
    $this-&gt;db-&gt;from('bands');
    $this-&gt;db-&gt;join('artist_bands','artist_bands.band_id = bands.bands_ref');
    $this-&gt;db-&gt;where('artist_bands.artist_id', $artist_ref);

    return $this-&gt;db-&gt;get()-&gt;result_array();
}
</code></pre>
